# Phase 2 — Feature Engineering Tool & LangChain Integration Bridge

## Summary
Implemented the Feature Engineering Tool (`FeatureTool`) for the AML detection pipeline, covering 4 feature families (`volume`, `threshold`, `network`, `velocity`) with DuckDB `FeatureRepo` caching support. Additionally, implemented the LangChain integration bridge (`to_langchain_tool()` / `get_langchain_tools()`) in `ToolSpec` and `ToolRegistry` to ensure all tools integrate seamlessly with LangChain models (`llm.bind_tools()`) and LangGraph (`ToolNode`).

